- op: discuss  # 94dd
  at: '2026-10-03T17:05:18Z'  # 94dd
  by: agent  # 94dd
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 94dd
  clock: 4  # 94dd
  nonce: 94dd  # 94dd
  message: "Merged in PR #1417 (dev c5249c1aa1).\n\nFixed on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows, commit a05b58014f. objc NSNotificationCenter post* (3 rows) and swift NotificationCenter.post are deleted. An in-process post crosses no process boundary, so there is no value to move them to. The Distributed* centers stay ipc_send.\n\nBehavioral evidence: `io-boundaries` on one-file objc and swift programs reports ipc_send = {NSDistributedNotificationCenter.postNotificationName:object:userInfo:deliverImmediately:} and {DistributedNotificationCenter.postNotificationName}. The in-process posts are now external_potential.\n\nRemoval direction read back on a corpus A/B. In verify-claims, every ipc_send chain lost was an in-process post: AFNetworking 8, ResearchKit 7, SDWebImage 5, CocoaLumberjack 3, Kingfisher 3, swift-composable-architecture 2. Arm B has none left, and the only ipc_send primitive that changed is the post. NO-IPC-SEND went violated→inconclusive on all six, never confirmed."  # 94dd
